    "agent_last_message": "Implemented the complete CLI in [output/main.py](/workspace/output/main.py).\n\nIt now:\n\n- Accepts exactly `--input` and `--output`\n- Reads the input file and computes:\n  - `lines` (per spec, including no-trailing-newline behavior)\n  - `words` (split only on ` `, `\\t`, `\\n`, `\\r`, `\\f`, `\\v`)\n  - `characters` (byte count)\n  - `unique_words` (case-insensitive via lowercase)\n  - `top_words` (up to 10, sorted by `count` desc then `word` asc)\n- Writes the required JSON object to the output path\n- Returns exit codes:\n  - `0` success\n  - `1` invalid invocation / bad input file (missing args, unknown args, unreadable input, malformed UTF-8 text)\n  - `2` unexpected internal error\n\nI also verified it compiles and exercised edge cases from the spec (empty file, whitespace-only, trailing newline vs none, multiple newlines, tie ordering, invalid args, missing input).",
